        "text": "**Defining Content Moderation**\n\nI've finished the initial implementation of `moderate_text.py`. It leverages the Google Cloud Natural Language API, specifically `LanguageServiceClient` from `google.cloud.language_v1`. I've documented the choice and provided comments on interpreting \"unsafe\" content based on text classification.\n\n\n**Concluding Implementation Steps**\n\nI've completed the implementation; the `moderate_text.py` file is operational and leverages the Google Cloud Natural Language API as specified. The `google.cloud.language_v1` library and `LanguageServiceClient` are instrumental here. I've also added comments explaining my reasoning and how to interpret \"unsafe\" text through classification. The task is fully executed.\n\n\n",
